<ul dir="auto">
<li>Do not skip handshake delay for URL test. <strong>1</strong></li>
<li>Dashboard: Control group test manually and add progress</li>
<li>Add ripple for top bar title</li>
<li>ConfigurationScreen: Add back scroll to gesture</li>
<li>AnyTLS: Admit URL fragment as name</li>
<li>Route: Add bridge outbound on desktop.</li>
<li>Android-like preference.</li>
<li>Fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto"><strong>1</strong></p>
<p dir="auto">Don&#39;t panic when you finding your configuration&#39;s latency increase. We just unified the URL test logic.</p>

